        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2d40f4af",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "主要是为追查残星会时，伪装身份潜入所用。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "珍贵之物"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9eccbbbd",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "一方面是为了低调行事，另一方面则是单纯觉得有趣以及有仪式感。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "珍贵之物"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6dcc3dbc",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "曾被人评价说戴这副眼镜就像要去装正经学者骗人了，他也会相当入戏地扶扶眼镜，故作矜持说你说得对。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "珍贵之物"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1933ed3a",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "医用手套",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "珍贵之物"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_759416a3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "一副纯白色的医用手套。手套下掩藏着声痕，同时也是旧伤的所在之处，伤口处至今仍会渗出被称为“日髓”的黄金血液。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "珍贵之物"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6afb5ccf",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "血液于他是力量之源，于常人却是灼人的危险。因此，他将这抹金色连同过往的痕迹，一并妥帖地收敛于洁净的布料之后。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "珍贵之物"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_213c56a5",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "褪色的糖纸书签",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2,
        "keywords": [
          "珍贵之物"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2f4e59db",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "桌上摆放的书里，夹着一张边缘微微卷曲的糖纸，糖纸上印着早已停产的“阳光小熊”图案。这是他年幼时，父亲时不时会给予的奖励。如今，父亲与那个“家”都已不在，糖也早已不再生产。他将这张褪色的糖纸压平，当作书签，像是将那段充满矛盾与痛苦的童年，最终提炼成了一张薄而坚韧的、可以平静夹入记忆的书签。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2,
        "keywords": [
          "珍贵之物"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}